WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:06.993
Your people bring the ideas, the craft, and the judgement.
Here, the studio decides what makes the game fun.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:17.117
Ask Exec to draft the playtest invitation. Five pairs.
Twenty minutes. This Friday.

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:27.430
While it drafts, you keep shaping the experience.

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:35.374
There is the invitation, written into the shared brief.

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:42.941
And Exec confirms it is saved. The draft is ready for your
team to review.

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:49.581
Next, open the shared computer and try the game.

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:57.777
One lantern. Then the other. Does cooperation feel
rewarding? That is for the people making the game to
judge.

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:10.590
Keep the quiet pace. Ask each pair when they first needed
each other.

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:18.021
That decision is saved beside the work.

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:24.111
Restless brings your people and AI together, so there is
more time for the work you are here to do.
